        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00128:alt:fig-00002-alt",
          "text": "Two reactions in presence of sodium ethoxide and ethanol. 2-Bromobutane reacts to form 2-butene (81%) and 1-butene (19%). In the second reaction, 2-bromo-2-methylbutane yields 2-methyl-2-butene (70%) and 2-methyl-1-butene (30%)."
