        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00128:alt:fig-00003-alt",
          "text": "E1 reaction mechanism. Halide leaves alkyl halide to produce carbocation, and base abstracts hydrogen on adjacent carbon to yield alkene."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_11_07_003.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
