        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00128:alt:fig-00004-alt",
          "text": "E2 reaction mechanism. Base abstracts hydrogen adjacent to halogen on alkyl halide; movement of electrons results in halide leaving and forming double bond, all in one step."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_11_07_004.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
      }
