          "segmentId": "m00128:alt:fig-00007-alt",
          "text": "E1cb reaction mechanism. Base abstracts hydrogen adjacent to halogen on alkyl halide, producing carbanion intermediate. Movement of electrons results in halide leaving, forming double bond."
